vs/workbench/contrib/terminal/common/ter.terminal.integrated.commandsToSkipShell:
A set of command IDs whose keybindings will not be sent to the shell but instead always be handled oleh VS Code. This allows keybindings that would normally be consumed oleh the shell to act instead the same as when the terminal is not focused, untuk example `Ctrl+P` to launch Quick buka.

&nbsp;

Many commands are skipped secara bawaan. To override a bawaan dan pass that command's keybinding to the shell instead, add the command prefixed dengan the `-` character. untuk example add `-workbench.action.quickOpen` to allow `Ctrl+P` to reach the shell.

&nbsp;

