vs/workbench/contrib/welcomeGettingStart.gettingStarted.verbositySettings.descrip:
Screen reader verbosity pengaturan exist untuk features around the workbench so that once a user is familiar dengan a feature, they can avoid hearing hints about how to operate it. untuk example, features untuk which an accessibility help dialog exists will indicate how to buka the dialog until the verbosity pengaturan untuk that feature has been dinonaktifkan.
